section.about-section
  .container
    .row.align-items-start.g-5
      
      / Left: Image
      .col-12.col-lg-6
        = image_tag "about-image.webp", alt: "About image", class: "about-section__image", loading: "lazy"

      / Right: Content
      .col-12.col-lg-6
        p.about-section__eyebrow
          | About
        
        h2.about-section__title
          | Rooted in Faith. Growing Together.

        p.about-section__text
          | [Church Name] Parish is a Christ-centered community dedicated to worship, sacrament, and spiritual growth.

        .about-section__contact
          span Street, Barangay, City
          span +63 946 166 6435

        / Accordion-style mission items
        .about-section__accordion
          - 3.times do
            .about-section__item
              span.about-section__item-title
                | Our Mission
              span.about-section__item-toggle
                | ⌄

        a.about-section__cta href="#schedule"
          | About Our Church